206	     * {@link #registrationDate}: {@code MINOR} when under 18 years old, {@code ADULT} when 18 to 64,
207	     * and {@code SENIOR} when 65 or over. {@code null} when the owner has no birth date (or no
208	     * registration date to compute against). Not persisted.
209	     */
210	    public String getAgeBand() {
