227	     * single Luhn check digit over the digits of {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8>}. Assigned at creation
228	     * (see {@code AssignOwnerMemberId}); it is the owner's single primary identifier, replacing the
229	     * former {@code customerCode}, {@code membershipNumber} and standalone {@code checkDigit}. Every
230	     * value that used to derive from the customer code — the {@link #getLocality() locality}, the
